10629090328"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:GGT9B_3.jpeg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/4/44/GGT9B_3.jpeg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20210629090235","caption":"Из альбома «Вагассиэртчи» · № 21","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/4/44/GGT9B_3.jpeg/revision/latest?cb=20210629090235"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Papawagashietchi_m!x_sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/fa/Papawagashietchi_m%21x_sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20250324215202","caption":"Отец Вагассьертчи (m!x & Meets)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Mamawagashietchi_m!x_sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/f5/Mamawagashietchi_m%21x_sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20250324215202","caption":"Мать Вагассьертчи (m!x & Meets)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Wagassiertchi_sprite_friends.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/8f/Wagassiertchi_sprite_friends.png/revision/latest?cb=20150114053815","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Вагассиэртчи","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Wagashietchi-sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/de/Wagashietchi-sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20130805082802","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Вагассиэртчи","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Wagassiertchimix.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/18/Wagassiertchimix.png/revision/latest?cb=20160723221626","caption":"На изображении · Вагассиэртчи"}],"related":[{"id":"tamagotchi-4u-e5ac81","title":"Tamagotchi 4U","ru":"Tamagotchi 4U","kind":"device","note":"гость (NPC)"},{"id":"tamagotchi-4u-bcca85","title":"Tamagotchi 4U+","ru":"Tamagotchi 4U+","kind":"device","note":"гость (NPC)"},{"id":"tamagotchi-friends-fe748c","title":"Tamagotchi Friends",